      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard reads `systemd-journal`, `docker`, and `media-app-file-logs`, and excludes `01-observability-lxc` from the inbox.\n\nConnected systemd hosts: `01-backup-lxc`, `01-dns-lxc`, `01-edge-lxc`, `01-media-vm`, `01-reverse-proxy-lxc`, `01-tailscale-lxc`, `01-torrent-lxc`.\n\nConnected file-log apps: `bazarr`, `plex`, `prowlarr`, `qbittorrent`, `radarr`, `seerr`, `sonarr`, `tautulli`.\n\nThe Docker-specific panels only populate when matching warning/error lines come from container stdout/stderr with `container` or `compose_service` labels."
      }
    },
    {
